        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>环境类万能思路</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      padding: 10px 13px 10px 10px;\n    }\n    table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.12;\n    }\n    td {\n      border: 1px solid #555;\n      padding: 2px 4px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .title {\n      background: #f5cfaf;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      height: 22px;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    .section {\n      color: #f13b3b;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      height: 22px;\n      padding: 1px 0;\n    }\n    .left { width: 49.3%; }\n    .right { width: 50.7%; }\n    .row24 td { height: 24px; }\n    .row29 td { height: 29px; }\n    .row34 td { height: 34px; }\n    .vocab-title {\n      color: #f13b3b;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      height: 20px;\n      padding: 1px 4px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .vocab {\n      border-top: 0;\n      padding: 1px 5px 2px 5px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 17.7px;\n      vertical-align: top;\n      height: 299px;\n    }\n    .vline {\n      height: 17.7px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .c1, .c2, .c3, .c4 { display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; }\n    .c1 { width: 120px; }\n    .c2 { width: 131px; }\n    .c3 { width: 224px; }\n    .c4 { width: auto; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <table>\n      <tr><td class=\"title\" colspan=\"2\">环境类万能思路</td></tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"section\" colspan=\"2\">常见环境问题</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row24\">\n        <td class=\"left\">气候变化，全球变暖</td>\n        <td class=\"right\">Climate change, global warming</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"row24\">\n        <td>空气污染，垃圾增加</td>\n        <td>Air pollution, increase of rubbish/garbage</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"row24\">\n        <td>能源危机，水资源匮乏，森林减少</td>\n        <td>Energy crisis, water shortage, deforestation</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"row29\">\n        <td>自然灾害，酸雨、沙尘暴、干旱、水灾</td>\n        <td>Natural disasters, acid rain, sand storms,<br>drought, flood</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"section\" colspan=\"2\">所有这些问题的根本原因</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row29\">\n        <td>人口增长、工业发展、长期的人类活动</td>\n        <td>Population growth, industrial development,<br>long-term human activities</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"section\" colspan=\"2\">正确的解决方法</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row34\">\n        <td>世界方面：全球合作，达成共识，制定环境保护的国际标准</td>\n        <td>Global cooperation, reach the agreement, set<br>international standards for environmental</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"row24\">\n        <td>政府方面：制定环保政策，鼓励低碳经济</td>\n        <td>Make laws, encourage low carbon economy</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"row34\">\n        <td>科技方面：大力开发可再生的、清洁的新能源，投资研发节能科技</td>\n        <td>Exploit renewable, green energy, invest in<br>energy-saving technologies</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"row29\">\n        <td>公司方面：推出环保产品，引领大众绿色消费习惯</td>\n        <td>Promote environmentally-friendly products, lead<br>green consuming habits</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"row29\">\n        <td>个人方面：提升环保意识，倡导低碳生活方式</td>\n        <td>raise public’s green awareness, encourage low<br>carbon lifestyle</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"vocab-title\" colspan=\"2\">核心词汇及短语：</td></tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"vocab\" colspan=\"2\">\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">low carbon 低碳</span><span class=\"c2\">green adj. 环保的</span><span class=\"c3\">environmentally-friendly adj. 环保的</span><span class=\"c4\">eco-</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">friendly adj. 环保的</span><span class=\"c2\">ecosystem n. 生态系统</span><span class=\"c3\">environmental protection 环境保护</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">preserve vt. 保护</span><span class=\"c2\">sustainable development 可持续发展</span><span class=\"c3\">deplete natural resources 耗</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">尽自然资源</span><span class=\"c2\">leave a carbon footprint 留下一个碳化足迹</span><span class=\"c3\">discharge/release</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">pollutants into the environment 向环境排放污染物</span><span class=\"c2\"></span><span class=\"c3\">greenhouse effect 温室效应</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">global warming 全球变暖</span><span class=\"c2\">discharge vt. 排放</span><span class=\"c3\">toxic adj. 有毒的</span><span class=\"c4\">contaminate v.</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">污染</span><span class=\"c2\">degrade v. 恶化 降级</span><span class=\"c3\">deteriorate v. 恶化</span><span class=\"c4\">shortage n. 缺乏</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">少</span><span class=\"c2\">deficiency n. 缺乏 不足</span><span class=\"c3\">fight climate change 抵制气候变化</span><span class=\"c4\">improve air</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">quality 改善空气质量</span><span class=\"c2\">conserve energy 节约能源</span><span class=\"c3\">renewable energies such as wind,</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">hydro and solar powers 可再生能源，例如风能、水能和太阳能</span><span class=\"c2\"></span><span class=\"c3\">fuel-efficient vehicles</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">燃油高效汽车</span><span class=\"c2\">take public transit, carpool or ride a bicycle 乘坐公共交通，拼车或骑</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">自行车</span><span class=\"c2\">avoid using throw-away products 避免使用一次性产品</span><span class=\"c3\">environmental-</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">friendly products 环保产品</span><span class=\"c2\">eco-friendly alternatives/substitutions/replacements 生态友</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vline\"><span class=\"c1\">好的替代品</span><span class=\"c2\">sort the daily garbage 生活垃圾分类</span><span class=\"c3\">consume less and recycle more</span></div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
